(: Reconciliation: published NAV price vs. NAV computed from
   TotalNetAssetValue / SharesOutstanding (XPath 3.0: let expression). :)
for $sc in /FundsXML4/Funds/Fund/SingleFund/ShareClasses/ShareClass
let $calc := number($sc/TotalAssetValues/TotalAssetValue/TotalNetAssetValue/Amount)
             div number($sc/TotalAssetValues/TotalAssetValue/SharesOutstanding)
return concat($sc/Identifiers/ISIN, ': published=', $sc/Prices/Price/NavPrice,
              ' computed=', round-half-to-even($calc, 4))
